@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "无访问权限";
    ViewData["FullWidth"] = true;
}

<div class="error-page">
    <div class="error-code">403</div>
    <h1>这里暂不对你开放</h1>
    <p>你没有权限访问该页面。如果确信这是误判，请联系管理员提升角色权限。</p>
    <div class="d-flex gap-2 justify-content-center mt-4">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">返回首页</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Login">切换账号</a>
    </div>
</div>
